{"title":"2020 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1c","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The lines with equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8d653c62693362a0aa869a02ae7619c0e5354a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3x + 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/6/60699606e6522f6fb9a55f1ef00aa16235269eed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x + 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/9/b0994c1773d952818631070dbacce3c5a53042df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = mx + 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"17\" /> intersect at a single point. Determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By solving the system of equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/e/d1ed946835c39a535c077c56281ef2ecc40a2ae6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=3x+7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c4321eddef8604a06dab3dc88166cc7e35fa25d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x+9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />, we can get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/3/003925cbeb04e3d7884cc7a2216afa709d4b5a72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y)=(1, 10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"118\" height=\"20\" />. So, by plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/0/d60b5d8da26cb7ada23602a13bd176dd9f210b24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1, 10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"51\" height=\"20\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/8/008d543c64eeac97f0f4e087115b90c6dd3482c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=mx+17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"17\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/b/99b6b9500b816991db663a5046784cc60c1c7801.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10=m+17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/5/c75a6da8418620685e763d12795a4aaa69285e71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=-7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"65\" height=\"15\" />. There, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/6/f267c9638ff05a2fa30e4a6aac49d9a3aea99ba8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{-7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"36\" height=\"26\" />.\n</p><p>~originally by Yuhao2012\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018012617\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 54/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2135/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.904      1 2020_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    5.904      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35892:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018012617 and revision id 279167. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}